WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:02.790
At last...

00:03.160 --> 00:06.290
Tusker will be reborn!

00:14.980 --> 00:16.710
Has Tusker...

00:16.710 --> 00:19.840
Has Tusker been resurrected?

00:34.630 --> 00:42.240
Umareta machi o tooku hanarete atashi wa

00:42.240 --> 00:45.410
Utatte iru

00:45.410 --> 00:53.050
Yowai kokoro mo yureru omoi mo poketto ni

00:53.050 --> 00:56.320
Shimaikonde

00:56.320 --> 01:06.900
Te no naru hou e michi naru michi e

01:06.900 --> 01:12.330
Ayumou

01:12.330 --> 01:17.740
Susumou

01:17.740 --> 01:22.580
Dare ka no tame ja naku

01:22.580 --> 01:28.050
Aru ga mama hokoreru you ni

01:28.050 --> 01:33.520
Yoake ni taiyou ga noboru you ni

01:33.520 --> 01:38.760
Atashi wa melody o kizamu

01:38.760 --> 01:42.790
Hakanakutomo tsuyoku

01:44.430 --> 01:47.960
Atashi wa ikite yuku

01:54.880 --> 01:58.680
Episode 48
Advent

02:00.050 --> 02:03.020
Is... Is this Tusker?

02:07.860 --> 02:10.090
I..I can feel it...

02:10.090 --> 02:12.430
Such staggering power!

02:12.430 --> 02:14.900
Is this the power of Tusker?

02:31.850 --> 02:33.470
Lady Mirred!

02:38.550 --> 02:40.520
What happened?

02:41.520 --> 02:45.820
So, she couldn't defy fate after all?

02:50.830 --> 02:52.460
Mirred!

02:53.640 --> 02:55.340
Fools...

02:55.340 --> 02:57.130
Kill them!

03:02.080 --> 03:04.550
Now that Mirred has awakened,

03:04.550 --> 03:07.250
I have no further use for you people!

03:07.250 --> 03:08.880
Damn it...

03:15.960 --> 03:17.930
Lady Mirred!

03:19.760 --> 03:24.060
Gitra, even you turn against me?

03:25.070 --> 03:26.690
Garyu!

03:35.240 --> 03:37.040
Are you okay?

03:44.590 --> 03:45.920
Let's withdraw for now.

03:45.920 --> 03:49.720
But Lady Mirred...

03:49.720 --> 03:52.560
Stay if you want to die here.

03:52.560 --> 03:55.190
Gitra, we have to make a temporary retreat!

04:04.470 --> 04:07.380
I finally have it...

04:07.380 --> 04:09.670
Tusker's power!

04:16.820 --> 04:18.590
Lady Mirred...

04:18.590 --> 04:22.590
I'm sorry I couldn't help her.

04:22.590 --> 04:23.630
What nonsense!

04:23.630 --> 04:24.660
What?

04:24.660 --> 04:26.790
Who cares about Mirred?

04:26.790 --> 04:30.590
The real regret is that you couldn't
get back Amir Gaul, right?

04:31.370 --> 04:35.670
And that I allowed Sachura to be
stolen from me so easily.

04:36.770 --> 04:38.400
Noah...

04:39.610 --> 04:42.410
I won't let things end like this.

04:54.720 --> 04:56.390
Hold up, Noah!

04:56.390 --> 05:00.630
You're going to sneak into the castle and
steal back your key spirit, right?

05:00.630 --> 05:03.030
I want to help Mirred,

05:03.030 --> 05:06.100
and I'll get back Amir Gaul too, of course!

05:06.100 --> 05:07.870
We're after the same things!

05:07.870 --> 05:09.670
Let's do this together!

05:10.340 --> 05:12.140
You have to be kidding.

05:13.010 --> 05:15.910
Me, team up with you?

05:15.910 --> 05:18.780
I'll do this my way.

05:18.780 --> 05:20.580
Noah!

05:20.580 --> 05:23.280
Get it through your thick head already.

05:23.280 --> 05:26.320
I am not your friend anymore.

05:26.320 --> 05:29.120
What's more, I can tell...

05:29.790 --> 05:33.750
You and I will be the ones to fight the final battle.

05:35.360 --> 05:36.990
Noah...

05:43.640 --> 05:45.970
Wait, Noah.

05:45.970 --> 05:47.680
Noah!

05:47.680 --> 05:49.780
Don't make me repeat myself.

05:49.780 --> 05:52.480
There is no " Noah. "

05:52.480 --> 05:55.450
He doesn't exist in this world.

06:02.920 --> 06:05.960
Rejoice, Lady Mirred.

06:05.960 --> 06:10.260
All six of the key spirits have gathered to you,

06:10.260 --> 06:14.500
and you have become the true savior.

06:14.500 --> 06:18.040
The true savior...

06:18.040 --> 06:21.480
Congratulations, Lady Mirred.

06:21.480 --> 06:26.440
Please use your power to lead Tusk
to even greater prosperity.

06:26.810 --> 06:30.620
No! I...

06:30.620 --> 06:35.080
I pledge my eternal allegiance to you,
the savior!

06:38.060 --> 06:39.130
Sir, we have a situation!

06:39.130 --> 06:41.460
Down below the beastmen are acting up.

06:41.460 --> 06:43.230
They've begun to kill each other!

06:43.230 --> 06:44.830
What?

06:44.830 --> 06:48.270
Some of them have even become cannibals!

06:48.270 --> 06:50.740
What could this mean?

07:07.920 --> 07:09.890
What an ugly sight...

07:10.960 --> 07:17.670
Gr..Great Tusker's appearance must
be affecting them somehow.

07:17.670 --> 07:21.290
The bloodline of the beastmen
has never been diluted.

07:24.570 --> 07:27.180
The beastmen are little better than mere beasts.

07:27.180 --> 07:30.280
Their existence itself is practically worthless.

07:30.280 --> 07:34.080
If their species brings itself to ruin,
isn't that fine with us?

07:40.350 --> 07:44.090
All the key spirits have gone inside Lady Mirred.

07:44.090 --> 07:47.800
There's no way to save her anymore.

07:47.800 --> 07:51.090
In the end, I couldn't do anything for her.

07:53.070 --> 07:58.170
I haven't given up on getting the
key spirits yet, you know.

07:58.170 --> 07:59.970
Zed?

07:59.970 --> 08:02.740
I'm going to Mirred.

08:02.740 --> 08:05.370
I'm going to rescue her.

08:11.850 --> 08:14.820
I'm already a traitor to this country.

08:16.020 --> 08:18.650
I have nothing to lose.

08:21.030 --> 08:24.700
If we can save Lady Mirred,
then I'll fight with you!

08:24.700 --> 08:26.330
Sure...

08:43.950 --> 08:48.890
Do you know why Tusk is trying
to gain Tusker's power?

08:48.890 --> 08:50.690
How would I know?

08:51.460 --> 08:55.420
It's probably something like
"To rule all the lands, " right?

08:56.660 --> 09:02.470
A lot of lives have been lost because of
people's desire for that power.

09:03.540 --> 09:06.170
What the hell is Tusker, anyway?

09:07.680 --> 09:12.610
If nothing changes,
Tusk is destined to fall to ruin.

09:12.610 --> 09:14.240
What?

09:14.750 --> 09:17.750
Our soil is so barren no plants will grow in it.

09:17.750 --> 09:20.620
The number of species here is extremely small.

09:20.620 --> 09:24.760
Because of our strong shard energy
and overly-inbred lineage,

09:24.760 --> 09:28.430
the Tuskans are spiraling toward extinction.

09:28.430 --> 09:30.460
In order to stop that,

09:30.460 --> 09:34.200
we need an infusion of new bloodlines
from other territories,

09:34.200 --> 09:38.470
but Xeem doesn't understand that.

09:38.470 --> 09:43.010
He thinks that if Tusker is resurrected,
we'll somehow be saved,

09:43.010 --> 09:46.970
just like when Tusker gave birth
to all the lands in the legends.

09:48.120 --> 09:53.580
Even though really, nobody knows a
damn thing about Tusker's power.

10:24.920 --> 10:27.220
Why, if it isn't Gitra the Traitor.

10:28.120 --> 10:29.490
Molima!

10:29.490 --> 10:32.120
Now, I wonder why you came back here?

10:33.090 --> 10:36.720
Oh, my, so you're with him too.

10:39.130 --> 10:42.540
Lady Mirred is back in the north tower.

10:42.540 --> 10:45.160
Molima, are you...

10:46.770 --> 10:48.900
What is the meaning of this, Molima?!

10:51.310 --> 10:53.780
That man is a traitor.

10:53.780 --> 10:56.250
Molima, kill them both!

10:57.650 --> 10:58.520
Here we go!

10:58.520 --> 10:59.990
Right!
Here we go!

11:07.230 --> 11:08.330
Zed!

11:08.330 --> 11:10.960
Never mind me, just go!

11:23.740 --> 11:27.150
I will be the one to defeat you.

11:27.150 --> 11:29.620
That is our fate.

11:30.480 --> 11:32.110
Noah...

11:34.720 --> 11:36.690
Dispose of them!

11:46.000 --> 11:48.470
Intruders are on the rampage inside the castle.

11:48.470 --> 11:50.670
Fortify Lady Mirred's security!

11:50.670 --> 11:52.300
Yes, sir!

12:03.350 --> 12:04.980
Lady Mirred?

12:17.570 --> 12:19.190
Lady Mirred!

12:21.970 --> 12:23.770
What is...

12:26.710 --> 12:28.330
Lady Mirred!

12:30.440 --> 12:33.070
Are you all right, Lady Mirred?

12:36.250 --> 12:38.720
What in the hell happened here?

12:49.630 --> 12:51.260
Rashmantis!

12:57.470 --> 12:59.100
Rambos!

13:01.380 --> 13:03.170
Get back, Noah!

13:09.750 --> 13:12.220
Gitra, is Mirred safe?

13:12.220 --> 13:15.350
Yeah, she's safe, but she's acting a little strange.

13:16.060 --> 13:19.030
Inside me... Inside...

13:19.260 --> 13:21.060
What happened to her?

13:21.060 --> 13:22.860
I don't know!

13:32.340 --> 13:35.180
Anyway, we got to get out of here!

13:35.180 --> 13:36.970
Gaiser!

13:45.590 --> 13:47.380
Gaiser, this way!

13:52.960 --> 13:54.760
I'm going on ahead.

13:56.160 --> 13:57.790
Rambos!

14:05.540 --> 14:09.000
Damn that Gitra...

14:12.350 --> 14:14.650
Are you all right, Lady Mirred?

14:14.650 --> 14:18.450
There's someone inside me...

14:21.320 --> 14:25.260
I can hear someone's voice,

14:25.260 --> 14:28.460
and the voice is getting louder and louder.

14:28.460 --> 14:30.260
It's making me...

14:31.370 --> 14:33.330
Is that voice Tusker?

14:33.330 --> 14:35.700
I don't know.

14:35.700 --> 14:38.440
What will happen to me?

14:38.440 --> 14:41.780
I'm becoming someone else!

14:41.780 --> 14:43.580
I'm scared!

14:43.580 --> 14:45.280
This isn't me...

14:45.280 --> 14:45.980
This isn't me!

14:45.980 --> 14:48.920
Lady Mirred, calm down!
This isn't me!

14:48.920 --> 14:51.790
Now, give Zed the key spirits.

14:51.790 --> 14:53.290
I can't !

14:53.290 --> 14:56.720
I can't do anything of my own will anymore!

14:56.720 --> 14:57.730
Mirred...

14:57.730 --> 15:00.350
How about you hand over those key spirits?

15:01.630 --> 15:03.400
Noah...

15:03.400 --> 15:06.860
All the key spirits belong to me!

15:12.840 --> 15:14.470
Noah!

15:17.650 --> 15:20.450
I'll never let you have them!

15:20.450 --> 15:24.580
You're the last person I want to have them!

15:25.350 --> 15:29.920
Oh ho, now you're letting your hostility show.

15:29.920 --> 15:32.990
Apparently, you've finally gotten into the spirit.

15:32.990 --> 15:37.290
But I'll be the one to get Tusker's power!

15:47.270 --> 15:51.230
How about you return our savior?

15:51.680 --> 15:55.680
Lady Mirred doesn't want to be the savior!

15:55.680 --> 15:59.320
You're still spouting that nonsense?

15:59.320 --> 16:03.160
This all goes above and beyond
mere human feelings.

16:03.160 --> 16:05.630
What's more, even if his
resurrection is incomplete,

16:05.630 --> 16:10.800
Great Tusker has resurrected,
using Lady Mirred's body.

16:10.800 --> 16:13.270
I have no use for the likes of you anymore!

16:15.100 --> 16:16.730
Gaiser!

16:27.450 --> 16:30.520
I will save you.

16:30.520 --> 16:33.490
I'll free you from your fate.

16:35.660 --> 16:41.120
So, give me the key spirits inside you!

16:58.350 --> 17:01.310
Now great Tusker is truly resurrecting!

17:01.880 --> 17:04.850
Tusker's going to be resurrected?!

17:11.560 --> 17:12.660
Behold!

17:12.660 --> 17:17.200
This is surely proof that Lady Mirred is the savior!

17:17.200 --> 17:18.430
It's Tusker!

17:18.430 --> 17:20.900
Great Tusker has been resurrected!

17:32.750 --> 17:35.040
What? What went wrong?

17:35.880 --> 17:39.340
The key spirits separated.

17:47.860 --> 17:50.660
What the heck is going on?

17:51.600 --> 17:53.230
Amir Gaul!

17:55.540 --> 17:57.160
Impossible...

17:57.970 --> 18:02.710
What was that Tusker we saw, then?

18:02.710 --> 18:05.210
Does this mean it was imperfect?

18:05.210 --> 18:07.650
No, that makes no sense.

18:07.650 --> 18:10.620
Lady Mirred is the one true savior.

18:11.190 --> 18:15.490
And we'll get Tusker's power,

18:15.490 --> 18:19.560
and we'll lay the foundations of a new Tusk here,

18:19.560 --> 18:23.960
so that we will rule all the lands!

18:23.960 --> 18:27.730
Great Tusker, please...

18:27.730 --> 18:31.530
Please show yourself to us once more!

18:32.670 --> 18:34.470
Great Tusker!

18:41.720 --> 18:43.340
Xeem!

18:48.990 --> 18:50.090
Mirred!

18:50.090 --> 18:51.890
Lady Mirred!

18:54.700 --> 18:57.830
I was right, Mirred isn't the one.

18:57.830 --> 19:00.800
I am the true savior!

19:06.670 --> 19:08.300
Noah...

19:20.490 --> 19:22.960
If Mirred isn't the savior...

19:24.760 --> 19:26.730
Amir Gaul!

19:45.950 --> 19:47.740
Lady Mirred!

19:57.020 --> 19:58.650
Mirred!

20:06.930 --> 20:08.440
Noah...

20:08.440 --> 20:12.540
This goes to show that in the end,
I am the savior.

20:12.540 --> 20:16.170
Key spirits, come to me!

20:22.420 --> 20:24.210
Amir Gaul...

20:25.050 --> 20:28.920
I've gained five key spirits.

20:28.920 --> 20:30.960
There's only one more left,

20:30.960 --> 20:33.260
just your Amir Gaul.

20:33.260 --> 20:37.730
Noah, you shouldn't have any key spirits!

20:37.730 --> 20:40.570
The key spirits have made you evil!

20:40.570 --> 20:42.970
You're just like Mom.

20:42.970 --> 20:47.570
I'll let you hang on to Amir Gaul for a little longer.

20:47.570 --> 20:53.480
I'm sure there will be a suitable place
and time for us to settle things.

20:53.480 --> 20:55.980
Yeah, I'll settle this for sure.

20:55.980 --> 20:58.120
I'll do it to save you!

20:58.120 --> 21:00.050
Save me?

21:00.050 --> 21:01.850
Don't make me laugh!

21:02.820 --> 21:04.620
Noah...

21:09.530 --> 21:11.160
Noah...

21:14.670 --> 21:16.700
What a pretty sky.

21:16.700 --> 21:19.670
It's so, so pretty.

21:21.010 --> 21:23.980
Come, Lady Mirred.

21:24.780 --> 21:27.410
Oh, who are you?

21:28.880 --> 21:31.350
She's even lost her memories.

21:31.350 --> 21:34.020
Did we really do right by her?

21:34.020 --> 21:38.150
Yes, I think she would say so.

21:39.860 --> 21:41.900
Because she's been released from
the spell that bound her,

21:41.900 --> 21:45.230
and now she can live freely.

21:45.230 --> 21:49.860
I'll see her through to the end.

21:50.840 --> 21:52.460
Gitra...

22:07.490 --> 22:09.890
Now, shall we go?

22:09.890 --> 22:11.220
Where to?

22:11.220 --> 22:12.990
Let's see...

22:12.990 --> 22:15.930
How about to a place where
we can see an even prettier sky?

22:15.930 --> 22:17.900
Really?!

22:30.710 --> 22:33.510
My Amir Gaul...

22:39.620 --> 22:44.920
Wazurawashii toko kara hanarete

22:45.860 --> 22:49.230
Habatakitakatta dake

22:49.230 --> 22:54.430
Mou kodomo ja nai no ni to

22:54.430 --> 23:00.070
Nando jibun o shikatta darou

23:01.140 --> 23:05.980
Yakusoku sareta basho made

23:05.980 --> 23:11.620
Hitasura susumu dake sa

23:11.620 --> 23:17.220
Bokura no tsubasa wa

23:17.220 --> 23:24.000
Honmono no totemo totemo kirei na hane dakara

23:24.000 --> 23:33.740
Donna hageshii ooki na kaze ni mo makenai

23:33.740 --> 23:43.820
Tooku e tooku e hitasura tobun da

23:43.820 --> 23:49.560
Hora mou kaze ni natte

23:49.560 --> 23:57.930
Anna ni namida o koraeta hi mo waraeru kara

23:59.930 --> 24:03.890
Sekai no hate made

24:17.750 --> 24:20.950
Next Time
Mother and Child

24:18.520 --> 24:20.950


Next time, "Mother and Child"
